---
// LANDING PAGE — gut repair. Template for all future /go/* marketing LPs.
// Standalone (hideChrome): no navbar, no footer maze — one message, one action.
// Primary CTA = free Rx gut consult (live today). Biome NS Ultra OTC card gets
// added the day it is orderable (no-coming-soon rule — never promise, only sell).
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import MedicalDisclaimer from '../../components/MedicalDisclaimer.astro';

const title = 'Gut Repair for Men — Fix the Gut, Protect the Mind — My4MLife';
const description = 'Bloating, brain fog, the 2pm crash — your gut is degrading the brain it feeds. Free physician-reviewed gut repair consult for men.';
const canonical = 'https://www.my4mlife.com/go/gut-repair';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} robots="noindex,follow" hideChrome={true}>

<div class="lp">

  <header class="lp-top">
    <a class="lp-mark" href="/">My<b>4M</b>Life</a>
    <span class="lp-top-tag">The first brain-healthspan platform for men</span>
  </header>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="lp-hero">
    <p class="lp-kicker">Gut repair · built for men</p>
    <h1>Bloating. Brain fog. The 2&nbsp;p.m. crash.<br/>Your gut is telling you what your brain already feels.</h1>
    <p class="lp-punch">Gut damage doesn't stay in the gut. It degrades the organ that makes you <em>you</em> — and it starts years before any diagnosis.</p>
    <p class="lp-cta-sub">Two ways to start — order the foundation powder today, or begin with a free physician consult.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- BUY PANELS — the two paths, up top -->
  <section class="lp-block lp-buy">
    <div class="lp-paths">
      <div class="lp-path-card lp-path-primary">
        <p class="lp-path-tag">OTC · ships to your door</p>
        <h3>Biome NS Ultra</h3>
        <p>The daily gut-brain foundation powder. Order today, ships to your door. No prescription, no waiting.</p>
        <div class="lp-buy-btns">
          <button class="lp-cta" id="buy-biome-once" data-sku="biome-ns-ultra" onclick="window.posthog && posthog.capture('lp_gut_otc_order')">Order now — $149</button>
          <button class="lp-cta lp-cta-ghost" id="buy-biome-sub" data-sku="biome-ns-ultra-sub" onclick="window.posthog && posthog.capture('lp_gut_otc_subscribe')">Subscribe — $129/mo</button>
        </div>
        <p class="lp-fine" id="buy-biome-err" hidden></p>
        <p class="lp-bonus">✓ Free <strong>Fast Start Guide to Gut Repair</strong> — exact dosing + your 7-day fast start — emailed instantly with every order.</p>
        <p class="lp-fine">Secure checkout. US shipping collected at checkout.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-path-card">
        <p class="lp-path-tag">Rx · physician-guided</p>
        <h3>Biome NS Rx — our proprietary gut-repair prescription, written by your physician to your needs.</h3>
        <p><strong>Custom-formulated dosage based on your needs</strong> — determined by a physician in your free telemedicine consult.</p>
        <a class="lp-cta" href="/rx/leaky-gut/questionnaire" onclick="window.posthog && posthog.capture('lp_gut_cta_hero')">Start the free consult &rarr;</a>
        <p class="lp-fine">Consult is free. Medication billed separately only after physician approval — if you're not approved, you pay nothing.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STOP FIRST -->
  <section class="lp-block">
    <h2>Before anything else, stop the insulting behavior.</h2>
    <p class="lp-lead">Most men try to supplement their way past a gut they're actively injuring three times a day. Repair starts with removal:</p>
    <ul class="lp-stop">
      <li><strong>Seed-oil fried everything.</strong> Inflammatory oils are a daily blowtorch on your gut lining.</li>
      <li><strong>The nightly alcohol "unwind."</strong> It strips the mucosal barrier while you sleep.</li>
      <li><strong>NSAIDs as a habit, antacids as a lifestyle.</strong> Both mask the signal while widening the damage.</li>
      <li><strong>Probiotic roulette.</strong> Random strains from a warehouse shelf, dead on arrival, into a gut that can't host them yet.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <!-- MECHANISM -->
  <section class="lp-block lp-block-navy">
    <h2>Why the gut is where cognitive longevity starts</h2>
    <div class="lp-mech">
      <div class="lp-mech-item"><span class="lp-mech-n">~90%</span><p>of your serotonin is manufactured in the gut — mood, patience, and drive are gut products.</p></div>
      <div class="lp-mech-item"><span class="lp-mech-n">~50%</span><p>of your dopamine originates there too — motivation runs on what your gut makes.</p></div>
      <div class="lp-mech-item"><span class="lp-mech-n">1 nerve</span><p>The vagus nerve is a direct gut-to-brain highway. An inflamed gut sends inflamed signals — all day, every day.</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="lp-mech-close">When the gut lining fails, inflammatory load crosses into circulation, the signal degrades, and the brain pays the bill. That's why we start every man's protocol at the gut — and why your MindSpan Score counts gut repair before anything else. Gut inflammation is a MindSpan tax: it shows up in your score before it shows up anywhere else.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- NOT SURE? -->
  <section class="lp-block">
    <div class="lp-paths lp-paths-single">
      <div class="lp-path-card">
        <p class="lp-path-tag">Not sure it's your gut?</p>
        <h3>Get your MindSpan baseline</h3>
        <p>Ten questions, five minutes. See which factors — gut included — are driving your cognitive risk, and what to fix first. Free, and it comes with the book.</p>
        <a class="lp-cta lp-cta-ghost" href="/assessment" onclick="window.posthog && posthog.capture('lp_gut_cta_assessment')">Get your MindSpan baseline — free &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHY US / CLOSE -->
  <section class="lp-block lp-close">
    <h2>Built for men who plan to keep their edge</h2>
    <p class="lp-lead">Weight-loss shops sell you a scale number. We're after something bigger: the best mind possible until your last day of life. The gut is step one. <em>Begin with the end in mind.</em></p>
    <a class="lp-cta" href="/rx/leaky-gut/questionnaire" onclick="window.posthog && posthog.capture('lp_gut_cta_close')">Start your free gut repair consult &rarr;</a>
  </section>

  <footer class="lp-foot">
    <p class="lp-ns">Biome NS Rx — NS = NeuroSeal: the gut-brain seal that protects cognitive longevity.</p>
    <MedicalDisclaimer />
    <p class="lp-legal"><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a> · <a href="/terms">Terms</a> · <a href="/">my4mlife.com</a></p>
  </footer>

</div>

</BaseLayout>

<script is:inline define:vars={{ API: (import.meta.env.PUBLIC_LEAD_CAPTURE_API_URL ?? 'https://v9svm8ds74.execute-api.us-east-2.amazonaws.com') }}>
(function () {
  var err = document.getElementById('buy-biome-err');
  ['buy-biome-once', 'buy-biome-sub'].forEach(function (id) {
    var btn = document.getElementById(id);
    if (!btn) return;
    var original = btn.textContent;
    btn.addEventListener('click', async function () {
      btn.disabled = true;
      btn.textContent = 'Loading…';
      if (err) { err.hidden = true; err.textContent = ''; }
      try {
        var res = await fetch(API + '/api/create-checkout-session', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
          body: JSON.stringify({ skuId: btn.dataset.sku }),
        });
        var data = await res.json();
        if (!res.ok || !data.url) throw new Error(data.error || ('Checkout failed (' + res.status + ')'));
        window.location.href = data.url;
      } catch (e) {
        btn.disabled = false;
        btn.textContent = original;
        if (err) {
          err.hidden = false;
          err.textContent = (e && e.message) ? e.message : 'Something went wrong. Please try again.';
        }
      }
    });
  });
})();
</script>

<style>
.lp { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; color: #1f2d3d; background: #fdfcf9; }
.lp h1, .lp h2, .lp h3 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; }

.lp-top { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e2d4; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.lp-mark { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #0a1f44; text-decoration: none; }
.lp-mark b { color: #b9922e; }
.lp-top-tag { font-size: 0.68rem; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #8a8468; overflow-wrap: break-word; }

.lp-hero { background: linear-gradient(150deg, #0a1628 0%, #0a1f44 70%); color: #f2eee3; text-align: center; padding: 4.5rem 1.4rem 4rem; }
.lp-kicker { font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #d4af5a; margin: 0 0 1.1rem; }
.lp-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 4.4vw, 2.9rem); line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 auto 1.2rem; max-width: 820px; text-wrap: balance; color: #f2eee3; text-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); }
.lp-punch { font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.2rem); color: #c9d2e4; max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto 1.8rem; line-height: 1.6; }
.lp-punch em { color: #e3c98b; font-style: italic; }

.lp-cta { display: inline-block; background: #d4af5a; color: #0a1428; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.02rem; padding: 1rem 2.1rem; border-radius: 999px; text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.15s; }
.lp-cta:hover { background: #e3c98b; }
.lp-cta-ghost { background: transparent; border: 2px solid #0a1f44; color: #0a1f44; }
.lp-cta-ghost:hover { background: rgba(10,31,68,0.06); }
.lp-cta-sub { font-size: 0.82rem; color: #9fb0cc; max-width: 520px; margin: 1rem auto 0; line-height: 1.55; }

.lp-block { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3.5rem 1.4rem; }
.lp-block h2 { font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2rem); color: #0a1f44; margin: 0 0 1rem; text-wrap: balance; }
.lp-lead { font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.65; color: #3d4a5e; max-width: 68ch; }

.lp-stop { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 1.4rem 0 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.9rem; }
.lp-stop li { padding: 1rem 1.2rem; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e8e2d4; border-left: 3px solid #c0442e; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.98rem; line-height: 1.55; }
.lp-stop strong { color: #0a1f44; }

.lp-block-navy { max-width: none; background: #0a1f44; color: #e8ecf5; }
.lp-block-navy > * { max-width: 860px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
.lp-block-navy h2 { color: #f2eee3; }
.lp-mech { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.2rem; margin: 1.8rem auto; }
.lp-mech-item { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(212,175,90,0.35); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.3rem 1.2rem; }
.lp-mech-n { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.9rem; font-weight: 700; color: #d4af5a; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.lp-mech-item p { font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #c9d2e4; margin: 0; }
.lp-mech-close { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.65; color: #c9d2e4; }
@media (max-width: 680px) { .lp-mech { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

.lp-buy { padding-top: 2.2rem; padding-bottom: 1rem; }
.lp-buy .lp-paths { margin-top: 0; }
.lp-buy-btns { display: flex; gap: 0.7rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
button.lp-cta { border: none; cursor: pointer; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
button.lp-cta.lp-cta-ghost { border: 2px solid #0a1f44; }
button.lp-cta:disabled { opacity: 0.6; cursor: default; }
.lp-paths-single { grid-template-columns: 1fr; max-width: 560px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
.lp-paths { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.2rem; margin-top: 1.6rem; }
@media (max-width: 720px) { .lp-paths { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
.lp-path-card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e8e2d4; border-radius: 14px; padding: 1.7rem 1.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.8rem; align-items: flex-start; }
.lp-path-primary { border: 2px solid #d4af5a; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(10,31,68,0.08); }
.lp-path-tag { font-size: 0.66rem; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #b9922e; font-weight: 700; margin: 0; }
.lp-path-card h3 { font-size: 1.25rem; color: #0a1f44; margin: 0; }
.lp-path-card p { font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #3d4a5e; margin: 0; }
.lp-fine { font-size: 0.76rem; color: #8a93a5; }
.lp-bonus { font-size: 0.86rem; color: #d4af5a; margin: 10px 0 6px; line-height: 1.45; }
.lp-bonus strong { color: #e3c98b; }

.lp-close { text-align: center; }
.lp-close .lp-lead { margin: 0 auto 1.8rem; }
.lp-close em { color: #b9922e; }

.lp-foot { border-top: 1px solid #e8e2d4; padding: 2rem 1.4rem 2.5rem; text-align: center; }
.lp-ns { font-size: 0.72rem; color: #8a8468; font-style: italic; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
.lp-legal { font-size: 0.78rem; color: #8a93a5; margin-top: 1rem; }
.lp-legal a { color: #8a93a5; }
</style>
